---
const tiles = [
  {
    en: 'Reception — calm arrival, warm light',
    pt: 'Receção — chegada calma, luz quente',
  },
  {
    en: 'Grooming hall — precision tables & air quality',
    pt: 'Sala de estética — mesas de precisão e qualidade do ar',
  },
  {
    en: 'Portrait wall — celebrated clients',
    pt: 'Parede de retratos — clientes celebrados',
  },
  {
    en: 'Boutique shelf — curated coat care',
    pt: 'Prateleira boutique — cuidado de pelo curado',
  },
];
---

<section class="salon" id="salon" aria-labelledby="salon-heading">
  <div class="salon__head u-container" data-reveal>
    <p class="u-eyebrow salon__eyebrow">
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">The atelier</span><span class="i18n-pt" lang="pt">O atelier</span>
    </p>
    <h2 id="salon-heading" class="salon__title">
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">A quiet salon, built for focus.</span><span class="i18n-pt" lang="pt"
        >Um salão silencioso, pensado para o foco.</span
      >
    </h2>
    <p class="salon__lede">
      <span class="i18n-en" lang="en"
        >Materials, lighting, and acoustics are chosen to keep dogs relaxed. The environment should read as clearly as
        the grooming: intentional, understated, and immaculate.</span
      ><span class="i18n-pt" lang="pt"
        >Materiais, luz e acústica são escolhidos para manter os cães descontraídos. O ambiente deve ser tão claro
        quanto a estética: intencional, discreto e imaculado.</span
      >
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="salon__grid u-container" data-reveal>
    {
      tiles.map((t) => (
        <figure class="salon__tile">
          <div class="salon__photo" role="presentation" />
          <figcaption class="salon__cap">
            <span class="i18n-en" lang="en">{t.en}</span>
            <span class="i18n-pt" lang="pt">{t.pt}</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))
    }
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../styles/tokens' as *;

  .salon {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 6.5rem) 0;
    background: $sand;
  }

  .salon__eyebrow {
    color: $burgundy;
  }

  .salon__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.65rem);
    color: $burgundy;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .salon__lede {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba($charcoal, 0.78);
  }

  .salon__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .salon__tile {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .salon__photo {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    background:
      linear-gradient(120deg, rgba($burgundy, 0.12), transparent),
      linear-gradient(300deg, rgba($champagne, 0.25), #eae4dc);
    border: 1px solid rgba($burgundy, 0.06);
  }

  .salon__cap {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba($charcoal, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .salon__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .salon__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
